    "99+ languages" : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, engine card: how many languages it covers."
    },
    "A Claude Pro, Max, Team, or Enterprise chat subscription does not include API access. Create a separate API key in Claude Platform and add prepaid credits before using it here; Anthropic bills API usage separately from a chat subscription." : {},
    "A fill-in becomes the date, the time, or what you copied. Everything else is pasted as written, and AI Polish never rewrites it. Buttons add a fill-in at the end; you can move it anywhere." : {},
    "A language download is in progress. This updates when it finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Live Preview settings: status install in flight detail."
    },
    "A small capsule with the rainbow mark and a timer. The pill EnviousWispr has always shown." : {
      "comment" : "Appearance settings: description of the Capsule recording pill style."
    },
    "A snippet only fires when you say this word first. Say the trigger on its own and your dictation is left alone." : {},
    "A take is stuck. Restart the app." : {
      "comment" : "Pill: an earlier dictation is stuck and holds the speech engine. Must fit a small single-line pill (about 40 characters)."
    },
    "A wide panel that shows your words as you speak, growing a line at a time." : {
      "comment" : "Appearance settings: description of the Reading Well recording pill style."
    },
    "A wider capsule with a live rainbow meter of your voice beside the timer." : {
      "comment" : "Appearance settings: description of the Level Rail recording pill style."
    },
