    "On-screen preview pauses while Faster Transcription is on." : {
      "comment" : "On-screen preview status. Faster Transcription is the name of a setting."
    },
    "One model, no choices. There are no sizes to pick and no per-use cost. We maintain EG-1 and keep improving it, so you get consistent cleanup without tuning anything." : {},
    "One moment, still working on that" : {},
    "One per line: the trigger, then =, then the text. A tab, an arrow, or a comma work too. For text on several lines, paste exported JSON or CSV, or type \\n where a line should break." : {},
